#, python-brace-format
msgid "Added to the queue: NVIDIA's driver, series {series} ({flavor} kernel)."
msgstr "In die Warteschlange gestellt: NVIDIA-Treiber, Serie {series} (Kernel {flavor})."

#: zypp_desk/pages/drivers.py:580
msgid "openSUSE's non-free repository: programs openSUSE may share but not as free software."
msgstr "Die nicht-freie Paketquelle von openSUSE: Programme, die openSUSE weitergeben darf, aber nicht als freie Software."

#: zypp_desk/pages/drivers.py:582
